The Guardian of Giving held five sacred waters each dawn. She faced a choice: pour her waters into the Valley of Multiplication, where they would triple before reaching the Guardian of Return, or keep them for herself.

The Guardian of Return received whatever flowed to her, multiplied three times. She then chose how much to send back upstream through hidden channels, and how much to keep.

